 6. snmp_tiny.c — DATA GENERATOR
🎯 Purpose
👉 Fills the MIB with values

🔥 What it does
✅ At start:
Add:
- system name
- location
- description


✅ Every 2 seconds:
update heartbeat

Example:
1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → ...


🧠 Real Understanding
👉 This file = data creator
Without it:
❌ SNMP returns nothing


7. THREADING (VERY IMPORTANT IN YOUR PROJECT)
You have:
Thread 1:

heartbeat updating

Thread 2:

network listening


🧠 Why needed?
Without threads:
❌ program can’t do 2 things at same time

✅ With threads:
✔ update data
✔ listen to network
